cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use InfraCanvas in your work, please cite this repository."
title: "InfraCanvas: The Bidirectional IaC Workspace"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-31
abstract: >-
  InfraCanvas is the open-source Bidirectional IaC Workspace for AWS,
  Azure, Google Cloud, and Oracle Cloud. It turns prompts and diagrams into Terraform
  and Pulumi, imports infrastructure state into editable diagrams with StateLens, and
  maps TFwhy drift findings onto cloud architecture resources.
